{"uid":"4d4cbee9105ef29d","name":"test_a_registered_tool_module_can_run_in_a_separate_process","fullName":"tests.test_registered_tool_allowlist#test_a_registered_tool_module_can_run_in_a_separate_process","historyId":"9e2b96f0ba8b0fd715460604d3048103","time":{"start":1788299678668,"stop":1788299678701,"duration":33},"description":"The C8 *mechanism*, proven the only way that is not self-referential: ask the\n    tool what process it is in.\n\n    ``LocalSubprocessToolSandbox`` gained a ``module_path`` mode, so an installed\n    admin-registered module is imported **inside** the subprocess rather than in the\n    API server. The import moves too, which matters as much as the call: module-level\n    code used to execute in the control plane on first bind.\n\n    This pins the *mechanism*. That the runtime actually routes through it — and does so\n    by default rather than on request — is pinned separately by\n    ``test_the_runtime_binds_registered_tools_out_of_process_by_default`` below, because\n    a working mechanism nothing calls is the exact defect this repository has been\n    audited for.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>The C8 <em>mechanism</em>, proven the only way that is not self-referential: ask the<br />\ntool what process it is in.</p>\n<pre><code>``LocalSubprocessToolSandbox`` gained a ``module_path`` mode, so an installed\nadmin-registered module is imported **inside** the subprocess rather than in the\nAPI server. The import moves too, which matters as much as the call: module-level\ncode used to execute in the control plane on first bind.\n\nThis pins the *mechanism*. That the runtime actually routes through it — and does so\nby default rather than on request — is pinned separately by\n``test_the_runtime_binds_registered_tools_out_of_process_by_default`` below, because\na working mechanism nothing calls is the exact defect this repository has been\naudited for.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPa